Description: VDI service for linuxmuster.net on Proxmox
 edulution-linbo-vdi manages a pool of virtual desktops on a Proxmox VE node
 for a linuxmuster.net server. It builds a master VM from a LINBO image,
 converts it to a template, keeps a configurable number of linked clones
 running, and brokers desktop assignments to users.
 .
 The REST API lives in linuxmuster-api (/v1/vdi), which imports this package
 as a library. The systemd unit is only started once /etc/edulution/linbo-vdi/
 vdiConfig.json exists; run vdi-setup to create it.

